{#
settings/_calendar_behaviour.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
How the topbar's calendar button moves between views. One choice of three,
named for the views the button is left with:

  All three         mail → split → full width, the cycle it always had
  Full width only   mail ↔ the calendar full width   (skips the split)
  Split only        mail ↔ the calendar beside mail  (skips the full width)

One control and not a switch per view: two switches can both be on, which
would leave the button with nowhere to go, and a pane that has to say "turning
this on turns the other off" is describing its own mistake. The values are
CalendarSwitchSkip's, so the option's key is what is SKIPPED while its label
says what is LEFT — the first is what the code asks, the second what a person
chooses.

Submits on change and redirects, like the cards beside it: the choice decides
what the NEXT page draws, so there is nothing here worth streaming back.

Accepts:
  skip  CalendarSwitchSkip
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_calendar_behaviour_update') }}" data-turbo="false"
      data-controller="ui--auto-submit" class="px-4 py-3">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-calendar-behaviour') }}">

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.calendar_behaviour.button'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.calendar_behaviour.button_hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>

        <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
             role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'settings.calendar_behaviour.button'|trans }}">
            {% for option in enum('App\\Domain\\Enum\\Calendar\\CalendarSwitchSkip').cases() %}
                <label>
                    <input type="radio" name="skip" class="peer sr-only"
                           value="{{ option.value }}"
                           data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                           {{ option == skip ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <span class="{{ segText }}">{{ ('settings.calendar_behaviour.option_' ~ option.value)|trans }}</span>
                </label>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
